{
 "about": "Grounding eval for spine.ai's memory (RAG). Each question is something a QA engineer, the assistant or the planner asks about EVENTS. A question is answered at rank r when the r-th retrieved chunk contains EVERY string of at least one 'expect' group (case-insensitive; punctuation and underscores count as spaces; matched on whole words) and, when the group names kinds, the chunk is of one of those kinds. 'ground' says where the fact is true (code or data). Facts are matched by content, not by source, so a chunk from any source that states the fact counts. Never edit chunks to match this file; edit this file only when the underlying fact changes.",
